# Normalize EOL for all files that Git considers text files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never converted, never diffed or merged as text (Git would detect most of these on
# its own; stating it keeps `git diff` and merges from ever trying). See docs/REPO_SIZE.md.
*.png binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
